    <li><strong>A correction of common shorthand</strong> — this is often shared as &ldquo;an animation made with SVG&rdquo;; precisely, it is <strong>the next step beyond the SVG-pelican test, done in three.js</strong> (Karpathy's own framing). The article narrates that lineage.</li>
